<h2>Validation Portfolio</h2>

<p><strong>Methodology:</strong><br>
Offline Validation → Simulation → Hardware-in-the-Loop → Real Deployment
</p>

<p>
The objective is reproducible evidence rather than isolated demonstrations. The current public GSC-X sandbox ecosystem contains eight validated domain branches.
</p>

<hr>

<h3>Reliability Validation</h3>

<p>
<strong>NASA CMAPSS</strong><br>
709 Turbofan Engines<br>
Median WQS = 0.8916<br>
Detection = 100%<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>CWRU Bearings</strong><br>
F1 Score = 1.000<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>IMS Bearings</strong><br>
Lead Horizon = 13.64%<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<hr>

<h3>Industrial Validation</h3>

<p>
<strong>TRUE Industrial Benchmark</strong><br>
TRUE N3000 / N10000 industrial validation branch<br>
Safety improvement, unsafe-time reduction and productivity benchmarking<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>Hard Delay Factory TRUE N10000</strong><br>
GSC-X maintained 100% survival across 10 ms, 50 ms, 150 ms and 300 ms actuator delays<br>
PID survival dropped under severe 300 ms delay conditions<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>Industrial Productivity Validation</strong><br>
GSC-X achieved higher control productivity with lower energy burden in validated industrial benchmark conditions<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<hr>

<h3>Fusion Validation</h3>

<p>
<strong>Fusion TRUE N-series Validation</strong><br>
TRUE N3000, N10000, N100000 and N1000000 validation ladder<br>
Reduced unsafe time and improved yield-per-energy behavior across large-scale benchmark runs<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>Symbiotic Fusion TRUE N1000000</strong><br>
Validated long-run fusion-inspired nonlinear stability benchmark<br>
Unsafe-time reduction and energy-efficiency improvement compared with baseline runtime behavior<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>PTM / Metastability Analysis</strong><br>
Build-up, trigger, recovery, persistence and release dynamics analyzed as part of fusion sandbox validation<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<hr>

<h3>Spaceflight Validation</h3>

<p>
<strong>Rocket TRUE</strong><br>
PID Median Error = 80.224<br>
GSC-X Median Error = 18.481<br>
Result: 4.34× lower error; 9.43× productivity improvement<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>Guidance HARD TRUE N10000</strong><br>
PID Median Error = 10.986<br>
GSC-X Median Error = 0.604<br>
Result: 18.18× lower error<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>Waypoint TRUE N10000</strong><br>
PID Median Error = 5.141<br>
GSC-X Median Error = 1.438<br>
Result: 3.57× lower error<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

<p>
<strong>LunarLander Smoke Validation</strong><br>
Baseline Crash = 51.5%<br>
GSC-X Crash = 7.1%<br>
Result: 7.25× lower crash rate<br>
Status: VALIDATED
</p>

